<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZILIAN SOCCER RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZILIAN SOCCER RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of weekend</p>
<p>matches in the Sao Paulo and Rio de Janeiro soccer</p>
<p>championships.</p>
